      "body": "**<sub><sub>![P1 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P1-orange?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Point migration provenance at an ancestor of this release**\n\nThe registered introduction commit `b0779951...` is not an ancestor of the reviewed release: it and `d8883a20...` are sibling commits with parent `a81e48ea...`. The guarded release path in `scripts/production-release.mjs` runs `git merge-base --is-ancestor introducedBy releaseSha` and explicitly aborts when it returns false (`git merge-base -h` confirms that this option tests whether the first commit is an ancestor of the second), so attempting to release this commit cannot render or apply the new migration. Record provenance using a commit that is actually in this release's ancestry.\n\nUseful? React with \ud83d\udc4d\u00a0/ \ud83d\udc4e.",
