      "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Reset contact keys when abandoning a creation attempt**\n\nWhen a create request succeeds on the server but its response is lost, closing this dialog leaves `contactCreation` mounted with the old key even though the closed-state effect clears every field. Reopening the dialog and submitting an identical body for a distinct company therefore replays the permanent `(actor, key)` entry and silently returns the earlier Party instead of creating the new contact. Reset the helper when the dialog is abandoned, while retaining the key only for retries within the same open attempt; `LeadCreateDialog` and the Bookings contact dialog have the same lifecycle.\n\nUseful? React with \ud83d\udc4d\u00a0/ \ud83d\udc4e.",
