      "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Make retried musician account creation idempotent**\n\nWhen an internal Live Session submission creates an emailed musician and then fails later\u2014for example on another musician or the final intake request\u2014the retained key makes this call return the already-created Party on retry. `createPartyAndUser` then unconditionally calls `Admin.createUser` again, while that endpoint returns 409 whenever the Party already has a credential, so the intended retry can never progress past the first previously completed musician. Treat that existing account as success or make the downstream step idempotent.\n\nUseful? React with \ud83d\udc4d\u00a0/ \ud83d\udc4e.",
