      "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Prevent closing contact dialogs while creation is pending**\n\nWhen a user dismisses this dialog via Cancel, Escape, or the backdrop while `createCompanyMutation` is still pending, `open` becomes false and this reset discards the in-flight request's idempotency key even though the HTTP request continues. If the server commits but the response is lost, reopening and retrying sends a new key and creates a duplicate company. Keep the dialog from closing while pending or defer clearing the key until the request settles; `LeadCreateDialog` has the same unguarded close/reset sequence.\n\nUseful? React with \ud83d\udc4d\u00a0/ \ud83d\udc4e.",
